<title>USA: Kohl's sees 30 to 35 new stores in 1997.</title>
<headline>Kohl's sees 30 to 35 new stores in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>MENOMONEE FALLS, Wis. 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kohl's Corp said Friday it plans to open 30 to 35 department stores this year, giving it a total of 180 to 185 stores.</p>
<p>On March 14, Kohl's will hold grand openings for nine new stores, including the Washington and Baltimore markets.</p>
<p>A spokesman said an additional 11 grand openings are planned for April 18, and a possible 10 to 15 new stores may be opened in autumn.</p>
<p>As of March 14, Kohl's will have 159 stores in 18 states.</p>
<p>Kohl's is a value-oriented department store company.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
